printing.sizing_note = ʻOku fakahū ʻe he founga fakafeʻunga ʻa e ʻimisi ʻi he puha takitaha ʻo ʻikai kosi, pea tauhi hono fua ʻo e ongo tafaʻakí. ʻOku ngāueʻaki ʻe he lahi totonú ʻa e DPI ʻo e fakamatala; fakasiʻisiʻi ʻa e ngaahi laine pe kōlomu ʻo e kupengá kapau ʻoku ʻikai hao. Paaki ʻa e PDF ʻi he 100% ʻo ʻikai ngāueʻaki ʻa e fakafeʻunga ki he peesí.
