printing.limit = Kuo laka ʻa e ngāue pākí ʻi he fakangatangatá: ʻimisi ʻe 200, pikisi ʻe 40 miliona pe pikisi ʻe 32768 ʻi he tafaʻaki takitaha ʻo e ʻimisi takitaha, pe 256 MiB ʻo e fakamatala PDF kuo fakasiʻisiʻi.
printing.profile_error = ʻOku ʻikai totonu, ʻikai tatau pe ʻikai poupouʻi ʻa e fakamatala lanu ʻo e ʻimisi ko ʻení. ʻOku fiemaʻu ʻe he ngaahi channel CMYK/Lab tupuʻanga ʻi he fakamatala ha fakamatala lanu totonu kuo fakahū ʻi loto; ʻoku fiemaʻu ʻe he RGB ha fakamatala lanu RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = ʻOku ʻikai hao ʻa e ʻimisí ʻi he puha ko ʻení ʻi hono DPI ʻo e fakamatala. Ngāueʻaki ʻa e founga fakafeʻunga, fakasiʻisiʻi ʻa e ngaahi laine pe kōlomu, pe ngāueʻaki ha pepa lahi ange.
printing.caption_limit = ʻOku fuʻu lōloa ʻa e fakamatala nounou ʻo e tā ki he kupenga ko ʻení. Fakasiʻisiʻi ʻa e ngaahi laine pe kōlomu, fakanounou ʻa e fakamatala, pe tāmateʻi ʻa e ngaahi fakamatala nounou.
printing.font_error = ʻOku ʻikai maʻu ha font maʻá e fakamatala nounou ʻo e tā. Fokotuʻu ha font tohi pe tāmateʻi ʻa e ngaahi fakamatala nounou.
printing.no_document = Fakaava ha fakamatala pe fili ha ngaahi tā ʻi he fakahāʻanga ʻīmisí kimuʻa pea paaki.
printing.source_error = Naʻe ʻikai lava ʻo lau ha tā kuo fili, faile hoa kuo fakatonutonu, pe fakamatala nounou ʻo e tā. Naʻe ʻikai tauhi ha PDF.
printing.save_error = Naʻe ʻikai lava ʻo tauhi ʻa e PDF. Fili ha hingoa faile foʻou ʻi ha faile faʻoʻanga ʻe lava ke tohi ki ai; ʻoku ʻikai ʻaupito fetongi ʻa e ngaahi faile ʻoku ʻi aí.
